		{"id":"fcc68f46e697410b","type":"text","text":"    [ TP4056 Charger ] --(Switch)-- [ MT3608 Boost ] \n\n          |                               |\n     (LiPo Batt)                     (Adjust to 5V)\n                                          |\n   +--------------------------------------+-----------------------------------+\n\n   |                                      |                                   |\n   v                                      v                                   v\n[ DISPLAY (ILI9341) ]                [ ESP32 BOARD ]                  [ SD CARD MODULE ]\n  VCC <--------------------------------- 3.3V --------------------------------> VCC\n  GND <--------------------------------- GND ---------------------------------> GND\n  CLK (SCK) <--------------------------- GPIO 18 -----------------------------> CLK (SCK)\n  MISO (SDO) <-------------------------- GPIO 19 -----------------------------> MISO\n  MOSI (SDI) <-------------------------- GPIO 23 -----------------------------> MOSI\n  CS <---------------------------------- GPIO 5\n  D/C <--------------------------------- GPIO 2\n  RESET <------------------------------- GPIO 15\n\n                                     [ JOYSTICK ]\n                                      GPIO 12 <---- Up\n                                      GPIO 13 <---- Down\n                                      GPIO 14 <---- Left\n                                      GPIO 25 <---- Right\n                                      GPIO 26 <---- Click\n","x":-1449,"y":520,"width":618,"height":763},
		{"id":"b21d6f077c80d8c0","type":"text","text":"we chose a esp32 because its a budget sniffing attacking slayer\n","x":490,"y":-274,"width":250,"height":102},
